Package: cagmetaphone
Type: Package
Title: Double Metaphone Phonetic Encoding (CAG Implementation)
Version: 1.0.0
Author: Atharv Tyagi (Under Anil Kumar Goyal - SAO)
Maintainer: Atharv Tyagi <tatharv597@gmail.com>
Description: 
    An R implementation of the Double Metaphone phonetic encoding algorithm,
    it is designed for proper and detailed implementation and validated using
    large-scale synthetic and real-world name datasets. Designed for
    phonetic deduplication and audit use cases.
